# Which iPhone scripts/run_device.sh and scripts/device_smoke.sh install to.
# Copy this file to Config/Device.local (gitignored). DEVICE_ID=<identifier> in the environment still wins.
# Without this file the scripts use the one reachable paired iPhone, and stop if more than one is reachable.
# Identifiers: the Identifier column of `xcrun devicectl list devices`.
# The owner's iPhone 17 Pro:
DEVICE_ID=4FC3C1DC-B809-552A-B60F-B1723ADB45B8
